        "Id": 85,
        "ActionId": 85,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Drowning in the hallucination, Chrome no longer is able to exert control over his body. Still, he struggles to take out the contents of his carrying bag. Perhaps, it will be of some use to Wanshi."
